WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:01,811
Coming

2
00:00:01,811 --> 00:00:13,820
How can you eat staple food when you come to a place like this? You will feel full quickly, you know?

3
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:17,210
Eat more meat, whipped in the mirror

4
00:00:17,210 --> 00:00:19,560
I don't eat fish

5
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:22,560
What? As a bear tribe, you don’t eat fish?

6
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:28,720
Let me say it again, semi-thin people are not the same as thin people, and we all have different tastes

7
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:30,720
Okay, okay, got it

8
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:36,100
I've wanted to ask for a long time, why are you so good at eating?

9
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:39,100
You don’t understand this, right? I’m an old foodie.

10
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:44,100
When you eat something in your mouth and swallow it in your stomach, you will feel a sense of happiness and satisfaction.

11
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:47,480
People like you who work in the nutrition industry every day will not understand.

12
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:55,540
You will be happy when your stomach is full
